    "What is your relationship with mathematics?": "I’ve always found math a little intimidating, even though it's part of my vocational training. I like to think of it as a puzzle to be solved, and I enjoy the logic involved. I don’t do it for fun, but when I need to use it for a practical purpose, I’m okay with it. Math is something I’ve learned to live with rather than love.",
