    "Did you ever use AI to support your math learning in the last year? If yes, how was your experience?": "Yes, I used an AI app for basic algebra. It was helpful for checking my answers and explaining the steps. It wasn’t perfect, sometimes it made errors, but it was good for a quick review. I used it as a second opinion rather than a full replacement. It helped me feel more confident when I was stuck.",
