    "According to you, how can LLMs be used to innovate math learning in schools and universities?": "LLMs can provide personalized tutoring, explaining concepts in different ways. They can generate practice problems and give instant feedback. They can also offer explanations tailored to different learning styles. It’s not a replacement for teachers, but a helpful tool. Especially for students who maybe struggle with traditional teaching, LLMs can offer a more accessible, patient way to learn."
